OL,3,GNEWSADog lovers complete 'brutal'
OL,4,AAfrican river journey
OL,5,
OL,6,FTravelling near hippos and lions,
OL,7,Fcamping under the stars and tackling
OL,8,Fstrong headwinds ` one woman has
OL,9,Freflected on what it was like to paddle
OL,10,Fabout 70 miles (about 110km) along one
OL,11,Fof Africa's longest rivers.
OL,13,FDog lovers Kelly Magee, who owns
OL,14,FImmingham Dogs Home in North
OL,15,FLincolnshire, and volunteers Erica Fox
OL,16,Fand Ryan Day tackled the Zambezi River,
OL,17,Fraising more than #10,000 for the
OL,18,Forganisation.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
