OL,3,GNEWSADog lovers complete 'brutal'
OL,4,AAfrican river journey
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe adventure included two days in
OL,7,Finflatable two-person kayaks, another
OL,8,Ftwo in a six-person raft, and a fifth
OL,9,Fday white-water rafting the final 17
OL,10,Fmiles near Victoria Falls in Zimbabwe.
OL,12,FErica said the experience was
OL,13,F"life-changing" and she "cannot wait to
OL,14,Fgo back to Africa".
